  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You effortlessly show or suppress your spirit’s physical sign.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can show or suppress the physical sign of any spirit that you have forged a good pact with as a free action. You can show or suppress the physical sign of any spirit that you have forged a poor pact with as a move action.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Showing or suppressing the physical sign of a spirit that you have made a good pact with is a move action and you cannot suppress the physical sign of a spirit that you have made a poor pact with.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
